{"steam_appid":4160210,"steam_name":"The Artisan of Glimmith","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4160210/1205887579/74fb610767dea508fd097871e90bdcd3afc33940/1773764869/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773765723","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257305004/6f78e62b5718b60bb2bc1963141a9cd89df30788/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773765723","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/f76cd919eb3a6466522a7c9e36ac87bb30347b60/ss_f76cd919eb3a6466522a7c9e36ac87bb30347b60.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783439742","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/9af9d590fefec3623ee9efbf6e6e3083afb49501/ss_9af9d590fefec3623ee9efbf6e6e3083afb49501.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783439742","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/a5114eeec3d39d018816dcec174092169ba79599/ss_a5114eeec3d39d018816dcec174092169ba79599.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783439742","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/4178eded950e636545f803024d06df5987e3a963/ss_4178eded950e636545f803024d06df5987e3a963.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783439742","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/20554986426e6507a729d2798295ca4f0208b798/ss_20554986426e6507a729d2798295ca4f0208b798.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783439742"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/d8741b5d31fd4c9237d5993623e35f4f.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1024 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in the lands of Glimmith, a kingdom above the clouds. Your newest benefactor has hired you, a famed stained glass artisan, to help him restore the area to its former glory. However, he has given you an unusual stipulation: use whatever colors you please, so long as you follow the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/84f1cb4d25e06d68b9895b4a6a437330.poster.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/84f1cb4d25e06d68b9895b4a6a437330.webm?t=1783439742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/84f1cb4d25e06d68b9895b4a6a437330.mp4?t=1783439742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/ab92120d21ff344c087b50835e0f4887.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1024 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy hamlet, an enchanted forest, and a forlorn castle await. Keep your eyes open for hidden paths and secret puzzles nestled away for the most observant players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/4d1409977c83734369f7f80c677369e7.poster.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/4d1409977c83734369f7f80c677369e7.webm?t=1783439742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/4d1409977c83734369f7f80c677369e7.mp4?t=1783439742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/b1cc158de2f640a42f1e2b5a461edf85.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1024 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curated, Not Generated:</strong> Experience a journey handcrafted by human puzzle designers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety:</strong> Discover over 20 unique rule types while you color, cut, and join beautiful stained glass artworks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mastery:</strong> Optional finale puzzles put experts to the test. These challenges require you to use every trick you’ve learned to pass.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/b22d066aced2ef3f6250db8e04274b2a.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1024 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create your own puzzles and share them with the community using the in-game level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160210/extras/119eaa68cdc9fd4f097e935557b6573a.avif?t=1783439742\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or i5-6600, AMD Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 950, AMD Radeon RX 550, or a recent integrated GPU (e.g. Ryzen with Radeon Graphics)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-9300, AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 5500<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 4k video output requires a more powerful GPU</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Lunarch Studios"],"publishers":["Lunarch Studios","983 Interactive"],"release_date":"17 Mar, 2026"}